  "The preprint derives that a mid-task model switch must earn back cache writes: on Anthropic's sheet, Fable 5.1 to Sonnet 5 pays back after 291 requests with return (46 without), and Opus 5 to Sonnet 5 after 27 (8 without).": 1,
